    "detailed_description": "Rutie was previously known as the Warden Witch: a powerful Witch tasked with imprisoning and guarding all the world's evils. One day she overslept and one of the greatest evils, Azazoth, managed to escape and lay waste to the world in her absence! He was promptly recaptured by the other Witches, but not before leaving behind pieces of himself - dubbed Remnants by the High Coven - to continue to wreak havoc while he's imprisoned. Stripped of her title and demoted to the much weaker position of Duskwitch, Rutie is now forced to clean up after her mistakes and eliminate all the Remnants! Dodge, shoot and style your way through the apocalypse in this fast paced character action shooter hybrid! <br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">KEY FEATURES</h2></strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1624000/extras/eb9c078b7fa9933f081abf3646ec6cd6.poster.avif?t=1678450086\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1624000/extras/eb9c078b7fa9933f081abf3646ec6cd6.webm?t=1678450086\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1624000/extras/eb9c078b7fa9933f081abf3646ec6cd6.mp4?t=1678450086\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong><u>Stylish Witch Combat</u></strong><br>Fight your way through the end of the world and clean up in style with your Broom (that is also a gun)!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1624000/extras/187248cc9ffc4f4997f186f77f5aa983.poster.avif?t=1678450086\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1624000/extras/187248cc9ffc4f4997f186f77f5aa983.webm?t=1678450086\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1624000/extras/187248cc9ffc4f4997f186f77f5aa983.mp4?t=1678450086\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong><u>Style Switching System</u></strong><br>The Heroic Souls Rutie meets along her journey unlock new fighting styles and bullet types for her to use! <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1624000/extras/a37cf0f54b5b67d0eebbdd77927fb68c.poster.avif?t=1678450086\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1624000/extras/a37cf0f54b5b67d0eebbdd77927fb68c.webm?t=1678450086\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1624000/extras/a37cf0f54b5b67d0eebbdd77927fb68c.mp4?t=1678450086\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong><u>Fast Paced Magical Girl Action</u></strong><br>Switching styles allows Rutie to pull off incredible combos where the only limit is your imagination and how fast you can press those buttons!",
    "about_the_game": "Rutie was previously known as the Warden Witch: a powerful Witch tasked with imprisoning and guarding all the world's evils. One day she overslept and one of the greatest evils, Azazoth, managed to escape and lay waste to the world in her absence! He was promptly recaptured by the other Witches, but not before leaving behind pieces of himself - dubbed Remnants by the High Coven - to continue to wreak havoc while he's imprisoned. Stripped of her title and demoted to the much weaker position of Duskwitch, Rutie is now forced to clean up after her mistakes and eliminate all the Remnants! Dodge, shoot and style your way through the apocalypse in this fast paced character action shooter hybrid! <br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">KEY FEATURES</h2></strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1624000/extras/eb9c078b7fa9933f081abf3646ec6cd6.poster.avif?t=1678450086\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1624000/extras/eb9c078b7fa9933f081abf3646ec6cd6.webm?t=1678450086\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1624000/extras/eb9c078b7fa9933f081abf3646ec6cd6.mp4?t=1678450086\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong><u>Stylish Witch Combat</u></strong><br>Fight your way through the end of the world and clean up in style with your Broom (that is also a gun)!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1624000/extras/187248cc9ffc4f4997f186f77f5aa983.poster.avif?t=1678450086\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1624000/extras/187248cc9ffc4f4997f186f77f5aa983.webm?t=1678450086\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1624000/extras/187248cc9ffc4f4997f186f77f5aa983.mp4?t=1678450086\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong><u>Style Switching System</u></strong><br>The Heroic Souls Rutie meets along her journey unlock new fighting styles and bullet types for her to use! <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1624000/extras/a37cf0f54b5b67d0eebbdd77927fb68c.poster.avif?t=1678450086\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1624000/extras/a37cf0f54b5b67d0eebbdd77927fb68c.webm?t=1678450086\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1624000/extras/a37cf0f54b5b67d0eebbdd77927fb68c.mp4?t=1678450086\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong><u>Fast Paced Magical Girl Action</u></strong><br>Switching styles allows Rutie to pull off incredible combos where the only limit is your imagination and how fast you can press those buttons!",
